"Chainer is one of the rarest classes."
"It purportedly grants the most powerful wordchains and reduces their side effects."
"It is said to make a wordchain's payback car crash only severely injure you."
"Chainers use cross-dimensional barter, with breaks for meditation."
"No Chainer has publicly admitted to spell impressions, apparently a soft restriction."
"Public intel on Chainers is basic: stat bonuses and sparse starter skill lists."
"The Velra family hoards the Chainer class."
"Chainer grants no life extension."
"Gifted Chainers feel a chain's spheres of influence and balances; others just use them."
"Some Chainers are highly attuned to magic and can gauge a chain's strength and repercussions."
"All Chainer S-ranks take Mass Bestowal; one always supports the demon fight at Matadero."
"Chainers start with one skill plus special chains; leveling rarely yields another S skill."
"The System gives Chainers hand and pattern-memorization enhancements and few free points."
"Velra saying: 'Chainers always get more than they pay for.'"
"Chainer needs Artonan-like hands, at least eight fingers and something like thumbs."
"Chainer does not exist on most planets; Tmith's Avowed held Chainer jobs until humans came."
"It is called the safest class; Chainers work by appointment two or three times a month."
"The System changes Chainers so wordchains come easier to learn."
"S-rank Chainers also pick a second S skill from about thirty, sorted by Palace priority."
"Chainer foundation points are mostly preset: voice, linguistics, pattern memory, hearing, fingers."
"The Fetuna practice wordchains widely and have produced amazing Chainers."
"Mass Bestowal's package includes System targeting help, which can be switched off in a crisis."
"Old Chainers train for decades to cast unassisted, memorizing hundreds of chains."
"Most Chainers cannot stack more than a dozen casts of one wordchain on themselves."
"Chainers are not allowed in casinos."
"Velra Chainer hopefuls train from when they can talk, 32 hours a week and more in the final year."
